  "title": "Kavier: Simulating the Performance, Sustainability, and Efficiency of LLM Ecosystems under Inference and Training",
  "description": "LLM workloads, such as training, fine-tuning, and inference, are becoming too large even for massive-scale infrastructure. Kavier is a physics-driven simulator that predicts the performance, sustainability, and efficiency of LLM ecosystems under inference and fine-tuning workloads.",
